"Joss sells the runaways' stolen fleeces in Imra and keeps a third of the price."
"Joss meets a runaway at the dead oak below the ridge each time he loads for Imra."
"Joss hides the stolen fleeces under Barek's bales, so Barek would share the blame if found out."
"Joss would sell word of any strange stranger to the Sheem hawk in Imra for a silver talent."
